{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33296","headline":"南越谣 · 于濆","name":"南越谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢迢东南天，巨浸无津壖。\n雄风卷昏雾，干戈满楼船。\n此时尉佗心，儿童待幽燕。\n三寸陆贾舌，万里汉山川。\n若令交趾货，尽生虞芮田。\n天意苟如此，遐人谁肯怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}